WEBVTT

00:13:30.236 --> 00:13:31.996
Nešto nije u redu.

00:13:32.796 --> 00:13:34.476
Nešto je drugačije.

00:13:34.836 --> 00:13:36.676
Nisi više isti.

00:13:36.716 --> 00:13:38.116
Brineš me.

00:13:38.476 --> 00:13:39.876
Ustvrdite nešto.

00:13:40.556 --> 00:13:47.476
To ostavlja vrlo malo prostora
da čovjek skrene s razgovora.

00:13:50.196 --> 00:13:53.276
Nisi onakav kakvog te znam.

00:13:55.076 --> 00:13:57.356
I učinite to s ljubavlju i empatijom.

00:13:57.396 --> 00:14:00.396
I ono najvažnije,
ne pokušavajte riješiti problem.